WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.905 --> 00:00:03.916
Ah, the Quarter-Season Carnival

00:00:03.916 --> 00:00:05.291
My favorite time of year

00:00:05.291 --> 00:00:06.164
But what about the playoffs?

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:08.708
Oh Kareem, as a game manager on the Chiefs

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:10.500
I've learned to appreciate the little things

00:00:10.499 --> 00:00:13.458
like a long incremental drive that ends in a field goal

00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:16.000
or being at the top of the Week 4 power rankings

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.291
Step right up, step right up. Win a prize

00:00:17.291 --> 00:00:19.416
Just by making it to the two-minute warning

00:00:19.416 --> 00:00:20.250
with one timeout

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.791
Oh it is on! Time's yours fellas

00:00:22.791 --> 00:00:24.333
Time, time, time-out.  Ah sh-

00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:30.292
I won again Dad- I mean Coach

00:00:30.292 --> 00:00:33.791
Step right up, and I'll guess your weight within five pounds

00:00:33.791 --> 00:00:35.063
Hell no

00:00:35.063 --> 00:00:39.166
Great hit, that's OK, great sack, great hit, 
ow, that's OK though

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:45.375
For only four quarters, I'll predict your future

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:47.083
Ha ha ha ha ha

00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:48.397
Ow my back, ow ow ow

00:00:48.397 --> 00:00:50.583
What is your question?

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:54.083
Uh, when will Gronk die?

00:00:54.083 --> 00:00:55.958
June 9th

00:00:55.958 --> 00:00:58.218
2069

00:00:58.833 --> 00:00:59.914
Nice!

